::  c4: a |% minted against a fork goal whose options reach the same core
::  %hold twice (bare and under a face), so the chapter-count walk meets a
::  hold it has already seen (noun_seen_insert_structural, find.rs ~609-613).
|%
+$  foo  $_  ^?  |%  ++  a  *@
                 --
++  main
  |=  [a=@ b=?]
  =/  g  ^-  ?(foo x=foo)
         |%  ++  a  1
         --
  !>(g)
--
